{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a slice of the underground chaos in the <i>Mineral Madness Demo</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this special demo edition, you\u2019ll dive into fast-paced multiplayer matches and a relaxed sandbox mode to test your mole skills. Every cave is randomly generated, so no two matches are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/6d86a580c30e43a431bfaf3fde127d38.poster.avif?t=1755770498\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/6d86a580c30e43a431bfaf3fde127d38.webm?t=1755770498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/6d86a580c30e43a431bfaf3fde127d38.mp4?t=1755770498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included in the demo</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Free-for-All Mode</strong> \u2013 Up to 8 players in frantic digging, blasting, and grappling matches. Play via public matchmaking or private lobbies with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.poster.avif?t=1755770498\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.webm?t=1755770498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/86fc5a48523b8593ab8737734127bdcc.mp4?t=1755770498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player Sandbox Mode</strong> \u2013 Explore and dig at your own pace, perfect for practicing movement and destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.poster.avif?t=1755770498\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.webm?t=1755770498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/extras/0e5d2e74683503e88590c4cd1db03112.mp4?t=1755770498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomly Generated Maps</strong> \u2013 Fresh underground arenas each match.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What\u2019s Included in the full version</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More tools, gadgets, and loadout customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team-based game modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power-ups and hotspots.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to dig, destroy, and outmaneuver rivals or just enjoy some peaceful tunneling in sandbox mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925360?t=1755770498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/6d930ef2bdfc412c7b2950568fe9dd574555017e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755770498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/5acb174767c3b988aabd35f7303c86645f157d01/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755770498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925360/5acb174767c3b988aabd35f7303c86645f157d01/c